Pivoting is the most underrated skill there is. Not just in business. The job that stopped fitting, the city that stopped fitting or the plan you outgrew. Everyone eventually hits the point where what got you here stops getting you forward.

And knowing is never the hard part. You always know first. The hard part is that the answer is buried under everything you’ve already built, so you circle the decision instead of making it.

& We did the same thing with our company. We knew we had to change how we work & decided to make the call once we could see things clearly.

If you’re circling a decision in your business right now and need clarity to move forward, this is your sign. 

